# What `railway up` must not upload.
#
# The tracked tree is ~300 KB. Without this, an upload would also carry
# node_modules (285 MB) and the embedding model cache (87 MB) — both of which
# the image rebuilds or bakes in anyway, so sending them is pure waste.
#
# .gitignore already covers these, but `railway up` deploys a directory rather
# than a commit, so this states it rather than relying on that.

node_modules/
.models-cache/
.git/
dist/
*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*

# Test-only; never part of the served artifact.
test/
